<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post6310630815202702291..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: Dhimmi Shelter (UPDATED)</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6310630815202702291/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/dhimmi-shelter.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>14</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3851906676972501413</id><published>2008-08-22T11:28:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2008-08-22T11:28:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Islam has from the time of The Pedophile Mohammad,...</title><content type='html'>Islam has from the time of The Pedophile Mohammad, been at war with the rest of the world [Dar al-Harb]. In other words, it was already at war for 1100 years before the US was founded.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;As for Dhimmi US:&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;The US has not formally submitted to Islam. But when US troops are fighting and dying in defence of Muslims, it is de facto Dhimmi.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;The same is true when the State Dept. bans any negative references to Jihad; when the US bombs Belgrade and establishes Muslim states in the Balkans; when the US arms and trains Muslim Palestinians, Afghan Mujihadeen; when the US media refuses to expose Obama&#39;s balatant lies about his Muslim background and upbringing; when the US ambassador to the UN is a Muslim citizen of Afghanistan; when the US president lies that &quot;Islam is a religion of peace.&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I find it funny (and disturbing) that many critics of the US try to claim that the US is at war with Islam. The opposite seems to be the case.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6310630815202702291/comments/default/3851906676972501413'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6310630815202702291/comments/default/3851906676972501413'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/dhimmi-shelter.html?showComment=1219426080000#c3851906676972501413' title=''/><author><name>brianakira</name><uri>http://brianakira.wordpress.com/</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/openid16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/dhimmi-shelter.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6310630815202702291' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6310630815202702291' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-717827952"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 22, 2008 at 11:28 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-550667718140959276</id><published>2008-01-12T16:09:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-01-12T16:09:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Thank you for explaining the practice of dhimma fr...</title><content type='html'>Thank you for explaining the practice of dhimma from a non-Likudnik perspective.  It&#39;s both worse than and more pervasive than I&#39;d been led to believe!&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;You&#39;re doing God&#39;s work, Mr. Grigg, by bringing this and related topics to light.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6310630815202702291/comments/default/550667718140959276'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6310630815202702291/comments/default/550667718140959276'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/dhimmi-shelter.html?showComment=1200179340000#c550667718140959276' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/dhimmi-shelter.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6310630815202702291' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6310630815202702291' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 12, 2008 at 4:09 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3617558056665009938</id><published>2008-01-10T17:54:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-01-10T17:54:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Would it be possible to list the book for sale by ...</title><content type='html'>Would it be possible to list the book for sale by some other means than eBay? How about Amazon.com marketplace?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6310630815202702291/comments/default/3617558056665009938'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6310630815202702291/comments/default/3617558056665009938'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/dhimmi-shelter.html?showComment=1200012840000#c3617558056665009938' title=''/><author><name>Keith</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14858190183366996406</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/dhimmi-shelter.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6310630815202702291' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6310630815202702291' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1255259382"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 10, 2008 at 5:54 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8973693431338835816</id><published>2008-01-10T15:07:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-01-10T15:07:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'></title><content type='html'>This comment has been removed by the author.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6310630815202702291/comments/default/8973693431338835816'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6310630815202702291/comments/default/8973693431338835816'/><author><name>joconnor3</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00793685202034508386</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/dhimmi-shelter.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6310630815202702291' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6310630815202702291' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name='blogger.contentRemoved' value='true'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-964193711"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 10, 2008 at 3:07 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8350624633494402355</id><published>2008-01-09T08:29:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-01-09T08:29:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>It is enough that the people know there was an ele...</title><content type='html'>It is enough that the people know there was an election. The people who cast the votes decide nothing. The people who count the votes decide everything. &lt;BR/&gt;Joseph Stalin</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6310630815202702291/comments/default/8350624633494402355'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6310630815202702291/comments/default/8350624633494402355'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/dhimmi-shelter.html?showComment=1199892540000#c8350624633494402355' title=''/><author><name>CK</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/dhimmi-shelter.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6310630815202702291' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6310630815202702291' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 9, 2008 at 8:29 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8869976754083191384</id><published>2008-01-09T07:26:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-01-09T07:26:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I had the same reaction about the New Hampshire re...</title><content type='html'>I had the &lt;A HREF=&quot;http://jemisonthorsby.blogspot.com/2008/01/live-free-or-die-my-foot.html&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;same reaction&lt;/A&gt; about the New Hampshire results.  So much for &quot;Live Free or Die.&quot;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6310630815202702291/comments/default/8869976754083191384'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6310630815202702291/comments/default/8869976754083191384'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/dhimmi-shelter.html?showComment=1199888760000#c8869976754083191384' title=''/><author><name>Jemison Thorsby</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/01063466545537540883</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='25' height='32' src='http://i233.photobucket.com/albums/ee140/JemisonThorsby/ist2_977339_celtic_crosscopy.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/dhimmi-shelter.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6310630815202702291' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6310630815202702291' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1056818916"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 9, 2008 at 7:26 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5709788427298783509</id><published>2008-01-09T06:02:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-01-09T06:02:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>So why is it (at least, so far) so difficult for v...</title><content type='html'>So why is it (at least, so far) so difficult for voters to grasp that the only candidate running for president who has the correct answers on foreign policy and the economy is Ron Paul?  It baffles me to see the &quot;Live Free or Die&quot; state go for a warmonger who will bankrupt this country (all candidates of all parties, except Ron Paul [and Dennis K except that he would still bankrupt us]).  &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Just amazing!  Louis Anderson</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6310630815202702291/comments/default/5709788427298783509'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6310630815202702291/comments/default/5709788427298783509'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/dhimmi-shelter.html?showComment=1199883720000#c5709788427298783509' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/dhimmi-shelter.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6310630815202702291' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6310630815202702291' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 9, 2008 at 6:02 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2065680626461330393</id><published>2008-01-08T21:19:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-01-08T21:19:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Bush and the &quot;Plunge Protection Team&quot; are going to...</title><content type='html'>Bush and the &quot;Plunge Protection Team&quot; are going to steal from those who guessed right about the markets by buying futures contracts on the stock indexes to support prices.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt; http://www.telegraph.co.uk/money/main.jhtml?view=DETAILS&amp;grid=A1YourView&amp;xml=/money/2008/01/07/ccview107.xml&lt;BR/&gt; Judging by a well-briefed report in the Washington Post, a mood of deep alarm has taken hold in the upper echelons of the administration. &quot;What everyone&#39;s looking at is what is the fastest way to get money out there,&quot; said a Bush aide.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;So, those who forecasted properly, based on the actual conditions in the economy, those who were short traders, will be ripped off and their money indirectly given to those who forecasted poorly. THAT sounds like a recipe for fiscal sanity. There is now NO way to meaningfully participate in the markets since an administration can arbitrarily interfere with cause and effect. Imagine that at a bureaucrats whim your calculator or computer would substitute 2.5 for pi. Lots of good engineering is going to happen NOW.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;And it gets better...&lt;BR/&gt; Emergency measures are now clearly on the agenda, apparently consisting of a mix of tax cuts for businesses and bungs for consumers.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Since the government isn&#39;t actually cutting spending we&#39;re just shifting from visible taxes to invisible taxes. It&#39;s like termites eating your home vs. having someone removing furniture -- you can at least account for missing furniture and take corrective actions. You don&#39;t know about the termites until the roof crashes down.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;The country is officially insane.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6310630815202702291/comments/default/2065680626461330393'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6310630815202702291/comments/default/2065680626461330393'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/dhimmi-shelter.html?showComment=1199852340000#c2065680626461330393' title=''/><author><name>joconnor3</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00793685202034508386</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/dhimmi-shelter.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6310630815202702291' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6310630815202702291' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-964193711"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 8, 2008 at 9:19 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3283757139907739181</id><published>2008-01-08T08:25:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-01-08T08:25:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>As is generally the case, great opinion piece. I p...</title><content type='html'>As is generally the case, great opinion piece. I posted it in the RP forums I spend time in.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Kicking the empire habit emotionally is difficult, but I did it. Getting the rest of the country to follow suit, short of total economic collapse, is going to be hard. Too many people substitute rabid nationalism for healthy things like family and church.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6310630815202702291/comments/default/3283757139907739181'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6310630815202702291/comments/default/3283757139907739181'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/dhimmi-shelter.html?showComment=1199805900000#c3283757139907739181' title=''/><author><name>joconnor3</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00793685202034508386</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/dhimmi-shelter.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6310630815202702291' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6310630815202702291' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-964193711"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 8, 2008 at 8:25 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2581235751478791082</id><published>2008-01-08T07:55:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-01-08T07:55:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Very well written post.  I recently wrote about th...</title><content type='html'>Very well written post.  I recently &lt;A HREF=&quot;http://jemisonthorsby.blogspot.com/2008/01/liquidation-of-america-inc.html&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;wrote&lt;/A&gt; about the &quot;fire sale&quot; of entities like CitiBank, tying it to Americans&#39; tendency to consume.  I failed to note also the link to our bankruptcy-inducing foreign policy.  My mistake.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Great comparison of historical dhimmitude with our current subservience to D.C.  Keep up the great work!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6310630815202702291/comments/default/2581235751478791082'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6310630815202702291/comments/default/2581235751478791082'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/dhimmi-shelter.html?showComment=1199804100000#c2581235751478791082' title=''/><author><name>Jemison Thorsby</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/01063466545537540883</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='25' height='32' src='http://i233.photobucket.com/albums/ee140/JemisonThorsby/ist2_977339_celtic_crosscopy.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/dhimmi-shelter.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6310630815202702291' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6310630815202702291' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1056818916"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 8, 2008 at 7:55 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1254275093955646349</id><published>2008-01-08T06:16:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-01-08T06:16:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>&quot;McCain didn&#39;t explain why Iraqis would be eager t...</title><content type='html'>&quot;McCain didn&#39;t explain why Iraqis would be eager to embrace ... a foreign occupation force well into the foreseeable future.&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Who can explain why Germany, Italy, Britain and Japan continue to embrace U.S. occupation troops, sixty-two (62) years after the war ended?&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Ron Paul is the sole candidate in our entire lifetimes to blurt out, &quot;Oh, no ... WE FORGOT TO DEMOBILIZE!&quot;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6310630815202702291/comments/default/1254275093955646349'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6310630815202702291/comments/default/1254275093955646349'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/dhimmi-shelter.html?showComment=1199798160000#c1254275093955646349' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/dhimmi-shelter.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6310630815202702291' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6310630815202702291' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 8, 2008 at 6:16 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-597773718699743005</id><published>2008-01-07T21:06:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-01-07T21:06:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Although not living abroad, I witness daily the sc...</title><content type='html'>Although not living abroad, I witness daily the scourge of hyperinflation.Working as a consulting forester many of my subcontractors who harvest and truck my timber are really struggling. I find it particularly hard to negotiate a set rate with the truckers. For those who do agree to a set rate you just know that they are agreeing because they need the work and that in the long run it is coming at the expense of their ability to build equity.I know of one contractor who spent $40,000 last month on diesel fuel alone. For a mid sized operation that is scary. Are wars abroad are being paid for through lost equity here. a</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6310630815202702291/comments/default/597773718699743005'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/631063081520